    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Crockahanny, Rossnowlagh\r\n\r\nUnique Residential Site -   3.45 Acres\r\n\r\nWith Full Planning Permission for Converted Barn\r\n\r\nOnly 1 km from Beach\r\n\r\nClosing Date for Unconditional Offers @ 12 noon Wednesday 2nd September, 2026\r\n\r\nElevated private setting situate just 1 km from Rossnowlagh Beach and the Sand House Hotel.\r\n\r\nPlanning Permission granted in 2025  (Planning Ref 25/50071) for Restoration / Conversion of existing historical Farm Sheds to 1 No. 4 B/r Residence  ( c. 210 sq.m.) and adjoining Detached Studio / Store (18 sq.m.);  Planning is for Permanent Use.\r\n\r\nGround Floor.\tOpen planned Kitchen with Dining and Living Area,  Utility,  2 No. \t\t\tBedrooms & Bathroom;\r\n\r\nFirst Floor.\t\t2 No. Bedrooms & Bathroom\r\n\r\nFor Direction Purposes only – From Rossnowlagh Beach, entrance to site is after F94 E1X9"
      }
    ],
